          "_name": "features11",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"features11\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Titel Anzeigen\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Untertitel Anzeigen\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Texttitel Anzeigen\" name=\"showTextHead\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text Anzeigen\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons Anzeigen\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Media Links/Rechts\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Media-Größe\" name=\"mediaSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"80\" step=\"5\" value=\"60\">\n        <select title=\"Karten\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Hintergrundbild\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background5.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Hintergrundvideo\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay-Farbe\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Transparenz\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n            <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-figure m-auto\" mbr-style=\"{'width': mediaSize + '%'}\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/the-core-2026ongoing-1-1920x1080.jpg\" alt title>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\" align-left aside-content\">\n                    <h2 class=\"mbr-title pt-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">INSTABILE KÖRPERBILDER\n<div>\n</div></h2>\n                    <div class=\"mbr-section-text\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mb-5 pt-3 mbr-light mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                        Klicken Sie auf den Text oder den Icon, um es zu bearbeiten oder zu stylen. Benutzen Sie Block-Parameter, um den Text oder die Icons zu verbergen/anzuzeigen und die Größe und Position von Bildern zu ändern.<br>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"block-content\" mbr-if=\"showTextHead||showText||showIcons\">\n                        <div class=\"card p-3 pr-3\">\n                            <div class=\"media\">\n                                <div class=\" align-self-center card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbri-extension mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                                </div>     \n                                <div class=\"media-body\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTextHead\">\n                                        Über 400 Umwerfende Blocks\n                                    </h4>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>                \n\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <p class=\"block-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><i><b>The Core, 2026–ongoing\n</b></i><br>Moving image, digital archive, installation research, dimensions / spatial layout variable (2016–ongoing)\n<br><i><br></i><br><i>The Core</i> emerges from an audiovisual investigation started in 2016 from a single recording of a bodily action. After years of digital editing, fragmentation, and intuitive manipulation without a prior script, isolating, slowing down, and recombining gestures until the original act became almost unrecognizable, the project resulted in 54 autonomous compositions (2020–21).\n<br>\n<br>Presented as an open archive rather than isolated works, the artist explores the relationships between them through rhythm, scale, and spatial arrangement.<i> The Core (Pulsations) Grid </i>serves as a first provisional mapping of these interactions. The central question raised is whether an accumulated transformation of a single bodily source can give rise to a new visual language that was not perceptible in the original recording.\n<br><br><br><i>The Core&nbsp;(Pulsations)</i>&nbsp;— Grid view, 2026-ongoing (silent) \n<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4hKLyvtsmiA\" target=\"_blank\">▶ Video</a>\n<br>\n<br><i>The Core</i> <i>(Pulsations) </i>— Detail, 2026 (silent) \n<br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/a4VxkwyCCDI\" target=\"_blank\">▶ Video</a>&nbsp;<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card p-3 pr-3\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                            <div class=\"media\">\n                                <div class=\"align-self-center card-img pb-3\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbri-drag-n-drop2 mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                                </div>     \n                                <div class=\"media-body\">\n                                    <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTextHead\">\n                                        Leicht und Einfach zu Gebrauchen\n                                    </h4>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>                \n\n                            <div class=\"card-box\">\n                                <p class=\"block-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\"><b>La Grieta (The Rift), 2025\n</b><br>Wood, acrylic, marker, terracotta, graphite, 131.8 × 109.2 × 8.4 cm\n<br>\n<br>La Grieta reorganizes discarded wooden fragments from a workshop in Hyderabad into an ambiguous structure between object, drawing and landscape. Marks resembling wheels, roofs and mountains are drawn across the surfaces, while an unreadable Hindi distribution mark is transformed from language into visual form. The work operates through a series of contextual shifts: discarded material becomes structure, writing becomes drawing, and fragments become possible images. An irregular opening exposes the wall behind the work, introducing absence as part of the composition and leaving recognition deliberately unresolved.<br></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div> \n              \n</section>",
