          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text, blockquote": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            ".mbr-text P": {
              "text-align": "right"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content1",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"mbr-section article content1\">\n    \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Content\" name=\"widthContent\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"mbr-text col-12 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': widthContent == 1, 'col-md-8': widthContent == 2, 'col-md-10': widthContent == 3, 'col-md-12': widthContent == 4}\"><p><b><i>Moving Image Selected Works</i></b></p></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content1-cu",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "vwcgjRzENg",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "background": "@bgColor",
            "& when (@fullWidth = false)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)"
            },
            "& when (@gradientBg)": {
              "background": "linear-gradient(45deg, @bgColor, @color2)"
            },
            ".image-block": {
              "margin": "auto",
              "& when (@fullWidth)": {
                "width": "100% !important"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-figure": {
              "margin": "0 auto"
            },
            "figcaption": {
              "position": "relative",
              "div": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "bottom": "0",
                "width": "100%"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
              ".image-block": {
                "width": "100% !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "image2",
          "_customHTML": "<section group=\"Images & Videos\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full-Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" value=\"4\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text Anzeigen\" name=\"showText\">        \n        \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Breite\" name=\"imageSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"100\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Farbverlauf\" name=\"gradientBg\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Farbe 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#149dcc\" condition=\"gradientBg && fullWidth==false\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <figure class=\"mbr-figure\" mbr-class=\"{'container':fullWidth==false}\">\n        <div class=\"image-block\" mbr-style=\"{'width':imageSize+'%'}\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/corporeo-2020-1-1228x691.jpg\" alt title>\n            <figcaption class=\"mbr-figure-caption mbr-figure-caption-over\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                <div mbr-text class=\"pb-5 px-3 mbr-white align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-figure-caption div\">\n                    Erstellen Sie fantastische Websites!\n                </div>\n            </figcaption>\n        </div>\n    </figure>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vwhU5gXb4m",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "image2-cw"
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            ".mbr-text P": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content3",
          "_customHTML": "<section mbr-id=\"_anchor\" mbr-paddings class=\"mbr-section article content3\">\n      \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) --> \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Content\" name=\"widthContent\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <select title=\"Karten\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->     \n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"row col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': widthContent == 1, 'col-md-8': widthContent == 2, 'col-md-10': widthContent == 3, 'col-md-12': widthContent == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-12': cardsAmount == 1, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\">\n                     <p><b>Volcano, 2015</b></p><p><b>Link: </b><a href=\"https://youtu.be/yQgYCf_ZGMM\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/yQgYCf_ZGMM</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                     <p>Single-channel video, color, sound, loop</p><p><i>Volcano </i>transforms the act of swallowing into an unstable encounter between anatomy and landscape. Repeated images of the artist’s head, neck and shoulders are multiplied at different scales and temporal intervals, causing the throat to oscillate between bodily detail and geological formation. The repetition intensifies the gesture of swallowing into a cycle of accumulation, pressure and release.</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">The transformation does not simply turn the body into a landscape; it unsettles the certainty with which the body can be recognized. What initially appears anatomical begins to operate according to another visual logic, somewhere between internal organ, geological formation and imagined terrain. The work uses this slippage to question how quickly perception constructs meaning from familiar forms—and how unstable that meaning becomes when the image no longer confirms what we believe we are seeing.</span><br></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n                     <p>Erstellen Sie Ihre eigene Website mit ein paar Klicks. Das Mobirise Programm kann Ihnen helfen, die Zeit für die Entwicklung Ihrer Website zu sparen, indem es einen flexiblen Website-Editor mit einem drag-and-drop Interface zur Verfügung stellt. Mobirise Website-Baukasten lässt Sie responsive und Mobile-freundliche Websites mit ein paar Klicks erstellen. Mobirise ist eins der einfachsten Tools für die Website-Entwicklung, die es heute gibt. Es ermöglicht Ihnen auch so viele Websites zu erstellen, wie Sie möchten und das im Angesicht der Tatsache, dass es eine Desktop-App ist.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content3-cp",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "vwc8IuYDTW",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "background": "@bgColor",
            "& when (@fullWidth = false)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)"
            },
            "& when (@gradientBg)": {
              "background": "linear-gradient(45deg, @bgColor, @color2)"
            },
            ".image-block": {
              "margin": "auto",
              "& when (@fullWidth)": {
