          "_name": "image2",
          "_customHTML": "<section group=\"Images & Videos\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full-Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" value=\"4\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text Anzeigen\" name=\"showText\">        \n        \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Breite\" name=\"imageSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"100\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Farbverlauf\" name=\"gradientBg\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Farbe 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#149dcc\" condition=\"gradientBg && fullWidth==false\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <figure class=\"mbr-figure\" mbr-class=\"{'container':fullWidth==false}\">\n        <div class=\"image-block\" mbr-style=\"{'width':imageSize+'%'}\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/troscurpos-fromthecrowntothewindbyarnaldodresgonzalez-wt.00-02-13-26.imagen-fija015-1228x691.png\" alt title>\n            <figcaption class=\"mbr-figure-caption mbr-figure-caption-over\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                <div mbr-text class=\"pb-5 px-3 mbr-white align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-figure-caption div\">\n                    Erstellen Sie fantastische Websites!\n                </div>\n            </figcaption>\n        </div>\n    </figure>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "image2-cy",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "vwhUWFhem5",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#767676"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content3",
          "_customHTML": "<section mbr-id=\"_anchor\" mbr-paddings class=\"mbr-section article content3\">\n      \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) --> \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Content\" name=\"widthContent\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <select title=\"Karten\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->     \n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"row col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': widthContent == 1, 'col-md-8': widthContent == 2, 'col-md-10': widthContent == 3, 'col-md-12': widthContent == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-12': cardsAmount == 1, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\">\n                     <p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/tPSnriVfcCU\" target=\"_blank\"></a><b>Troscurpos: De la Corona al Viento (From the Crown to the Wind), 2024-2026</b></p><p><b>Link: </b><a href=\"https://youtu.be/tPSnriVfcCU\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/tPSnriVfcCU</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                     <p>Single-channel video, black and white, sound, 5:12 min &nbsp;</p><p><i>Troscurpos </i>brings together fragments of body, landscape, machinery and historical imagery without allowing them to settle into a single narrative. A digitally fabricated image of an eroded crown appears as an ambiguous archaeological trace, while close-up gestures of hands, skin and folded arms gradually dissolve the human figure into a shifting terrain.</p><p>Sea, mist and tarp-covered machinery enter the image as fragments of an environment whose geographical and historical coordinates remain deliberately unstable. The body appears less as an individual figure than as a site where memory, territory and material history overlap.</p><p>The crown introduces a symbol associated with power, authority and historical continuity, yet its eroded and digitally constructed appearance undermines its status as evidence. Like the bodily images that surround it, it can be read as object, memory, fiction or trace.</p><p>Through this instability, <i>Troscurpos </i>examines how images can carry histories without providing a secure way of interpreting them. The work moves between what can be recognized and what must be imagined, asking how memory and belief enter when visual evidence remains incomplete.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n                     <p>Screenings</p><p>2026: Blackwood Filmfestival – Kurzfilmsause Freiburg, Freiburg (Germany) • STARPTELPA Riga Performance Festival (Latvia) • Public Shorts Video Festival, Berlin (Germany)</p><p>2025: Special Mention – Festival de Cine de Villa De Leyva (Colombia) • T.I.V.A. Tirana International Video Art Festival (Albania) • KURZFILMTAG, KulturEnergieBunker, Hamburg (Germany) • Écran Libre New Media Festival (Canada) • WNDX Festival of Moving Image (Canada) • Speak Volumes, Out of the Blue Cinema, Paris (France) • Mientras tanto Cine (Uruguay) • Movement and Light, GISELA, Berlin (Germany) • Tendermesh Film Fest, Berlin (Germany)</p><p>2024: Rare Effect Festival, Lisbon (Portugal) • Intermediaciones – Video Art and Experimental Video Showcase, Medellín (Colombia). \n</p><p><br></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
