          "_name": "content3",
          "_customHTML": "<section mbr-id=\"_anchor\" mbr-paddings class=\"mbr-section article content3\">\n      \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) --> \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Content\" name=\"widthContent\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <select title=\"Karten\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->     \n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"row col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': widthContent == 1, 'col-md-8': widthContent == 2, 'col-md-10': widthContent == 3, 'col-md-12': widthContent == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-12': cardsAmount == 1, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\">\n                     <p><b>Radar, 2023</b></p><p><b>Link: </b><a href=\"https://youtu.be/L_WuycuxeUE\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/L_WuycuxeUE</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                     <p>Single-channel video, black and white, sound, 09:34 min, loop</p><p>Radar begins with documentary recordings of people and vehicles waiting in lines in Venezuela. Rather than preserving these images as straightforward records of a social reality, the work progressively transforms them through extraction, monochrome processing and slowed temporal movement. Human figures and cars appear as unstable silhouettes that emerge, dissolve and reconfigure across the image.</p><p>An asynchronous radar graphic rotates through these sequences, introducing a second system of observation that does not fully correspond to what is being seen. The radar suggests detection, orientation and the possibility of locating something, while the images themselves resist providing a stable point of reference.</p><p>The work therefore moves between document and abstraction, evidence and interpretation. The recorded situation remains recognizable, but its transformation makes it increasingly difficult to read the image only as testimony. The viewer is placed in a condition of watching, searching and interpreting without complete visual confirmation.</p><p>In this sense, Radar is less concerned with representing a particular crisis than with examining what happens to an image when its documentary certainty begins to dissolve. The work turns the act of looking into a provisional form of orientation: we recognize fragments, construct relationships and search for meaning.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n                     <p>Erstellen Sie Ihre eigene Website mit ein paar Klicks. Das Mobirise Programm kann Ihnen helfen, die Zeit für die Entwicklung Ihrer Website zu sparen, indem es einen flexiblen Website-Editor mit einem drag-and-drop Interface zur Verfügung stellt. Mobirise Website-Baukasten lässt Sie responsive und Mobile-freundliche Websites mit ein paar Klicks erstellen. Mobirise ist eins der einfachsten Tools für die Website-Entwicklung, die es heute gibt. Es ermöglicht Ihnen auch so viele Websites zu erstellen, wie Sie möchten und das im Angesicht der Tatsache, dass es eine Desktop-App ist.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
