          "_name": "image2",
          "_customHTML": "<section group=\"Images & Videos\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) -->\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full-Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" value=\"4\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text Anzeigen\" name=\"showText\">        \n        \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Breite\" name=\"imageSize\" min=\"20\" max=\"100\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Farbverlauf\" name=\"gradientBg\" condition=\"fullWidth==false\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Farbe 2\" name=\"color2\" value=\"#149dcc\" condition=\"gradientBg && fullWidth==false\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <figure class=\"mbr-figure\" mbr-class=\"{'container':fullWidth==false}\">\n        <div class=\"image-block\" mbr-style=\"{'width':imageSize+'%'}\">\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/the-core-2026ongoing-2-3806x2141.jpg\" alt title>\n            <figcaption class=\"mbr-figure-caption mbr-figure-caption-over\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                <div mbr-text class=\"pb-5 px-3 mbr-white align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-figure-caption div\">\n                    Erstellen Sie fantastische Websites!\n                </div>\n            </figcaption>\n        </div>\n    </figure>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "image2-d1",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise4",
          "_cid": "vwhUZgPTaB",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 15px)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 15px)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#767676"
            },
            ".mbr-text P": {
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "content3",
          "_customHTML": "<section mbr-id=\"_anchor\" mbr-paddings class=\"mbr-section article content3\">\n      \n    <mbr-parameters>\n    <!-- Block parameters controls (Blue \"Gear\" panel) --> \n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Oben\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Unten\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Width Content\" name=\"widthContent\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <select title=\"Karten\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hintergrundfarbe\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <!-- End block parameters -->     \n    </mbr-parameters> \n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"media-container-row\">\n            <div class=\"row col-12\" mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': widthContent == 1, 'col-md-8': widthContent == 2, 'col-md-10': widthContent == 3, 'col-md-12': widthContent == 4}\">\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-12': cardsAmount == 1, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\">\n                     <p><b>Pulsations, 2026–ongoing</b></p><p><b>Link: </b><a href=\"https://youtu.be/4hKLyvtsmiA\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/4hKLyvtsmiA</a></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-class=\"{'col-md-6': cardsAmount == 2, 'col-md-4': cardsAmount == 3}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                     <p><span style=\"font-size: 1rem;\">Single-channel video, black and white, silent, loop</span></p><p><i>Pulsations</i>&nbsp;begins with recordings of the artist’s hands moving beneath a translucent textile. Through digital extraction, mirroring and recomposition, these gestures are transformed into ambiguous organic forms that expand, contract, open, close and repeat at different rhythms.</p><p>Presented as a modular field, the sequences invite the viewer to compare forms and behaviours: some appear identical, others seem to respond to one another, while their bodily origin remains concealed. The image becomes a field in which recognition is constantly proposed and withdrawn.</p><p>The work draws attention to the human tendency to construct relationships between forms, to identify patterns and to attribute behaviour even when the available information is incomplete. A gesture can appear anatomical, microscopic, biological or entirely imagined without becoming definitively any of these things.</p><p>Repetition therefore operates not only as a formal device but as a perceptual mechanism. It produces a situation in which the viewer is repeatedly asked to decide what is being seen, while the image continuously resists confirmation.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-4 mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-article data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n                     <p>Erstellen Sie Ihre eigene Website mit ein paar Klicks. Das Mobirise Programm kann Ihnen helfen, die Zeit für die Entwicklung Ihrer Website zu sparen, indem es einen flexiblen Website-Editor mit einem drag-and-drop Interface zur Verfügung stellt. Mobirise Website-Baukasten lässt Sie responsive und Mobile-freundliche Websites mit ein paar Klicks erstellen. Mobirise ist eins der einfachsten Tools für die Website-Entwicklung, die es heute gibt. Es ermöglicht Ihnen auch so viele Websites zu erstellen, wie Sie möchten und das im Angesicht der Tatsache, dass es eine Desktop-App ist.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
